[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16861.194, "timestamp": "04:41:01", "text": "それをマスターした。 [笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16863.27, "timestamp": "04:41:03", "text": "[息を呑む] 2秒目を見てみましょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16866.868, "timestamp": "04:41:06", "text": "詩。ええと、覚えていませんが、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16889.62, "timestamp": "04:41:29", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "By the way, how do they accept it with you not putting your name or address stuff though?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16892.39, "timestamp": "04:41:32", "text": "ああ、普通預金口座を持っています。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16897.03, "timestamp": "04:41:37", "text": "登録済みの事業。いいえ、私は法的に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16899.99, "timestamp": "04:41:39", "text": "私はビジネススレとして登録しました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16902.628, "timestamp": "04:41:42", "text": "所有者。それから私は電流を開放した"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16905.99, "timestamp": "04:41:45", "text": "私のチャンネル名のアカウントは、uh in にあります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16909.35, "timestamp": "04:41:49", "text": "銀行で。だから彼らは私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16911.75, "timestamp": "04:41:51", "text": "銀行名は私のチャンネル名になります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16913.43, "timestamp": "04:41:53", "text": "右？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16915.35, "timestamp": "04:41:55", "text": "行かなければならないことがたくさんあった"}]